        "answer": {
          "short": "$3.28\\text{ km}$",
          "worked": "Let $x$ be the eastward distance in kilometres. The angle between $AB$ and east is $90^\\circ-55^\\circ=35^\\circ$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\cos35^\\circ&=\\frac{x}{4}\\\\x&=4\\cos35^\\circ\\\\x&\\approx3.28\\text{ km}\\end{align*}$$",
